OL,3,GNEWSANHS Grampian staff 'should not    
OL,4,Acarry blame for leadership failures' - 
OL,5,Ahealth secretary                       
OL,7,FThe head of an independent review into 
OL,8,Fhow NHS Grampian handled certain       
OL,9,Fsurgeries, including liver and pancreas
OL,10,Foperations, will likely be appointed   
OL,11,Ffrom outside Scotland, Health Secretary
OL,12,FAngela Constance has told MSPs         
OL,14,FAt the weekend, the Scottish government
OL,15,Fordered the review in light of a       
OL,16,Fwhistleblower leaking a document       
OL,17,Fshowing there were 19 avoidable deaths 
OL,18,Fin the health board area               
OL,20,FConstance said staff in NHS Grampian   
OL,21,F"should not carry the blame for        
OL,22,Fleadership failures"                   
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
