OL,3,GNEWSANHS Grampian staff 'should not    
OL,4,Acarry blame for leadership failures' - 
OL,5,Ahealth secretary                       
OL,7,FOpposition members pressed the minister
OL,8,Fon how the review would work, who would
OL,9,Fbe appointed to it and what she wanted 
OL,10,Fthe outcome to be                      
OL,12,FThe statement came after First Minister
OL,13,FJohn Swinney answered backbench MSP    
OL,14,Fquestions                              
